    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "By Flagler News Weekly How did The Texas Tenors get started and is this the original trio? Yes, we are the original trio that started the group back in 2009. It’s always been us and has never changed. We sent a tape to America’s Got Talent in 2009 and they invited us to audition in...Continue reading"
