    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "  Las Vegas(KLAS) – Marcus Collins, J.C. Fisher and John Hagen, known as The Texas Tenors, are returning to Las Vegas for our shows at the Southpoint Casino. Guests can expect to hear songs from their new album “Outside the Lines” and covers from other artists. The Texas Tenors are celebrating their 15th anniversary. Show...Continue reading"
      }
    ],
